                    <div class="col-md-9 n-header-menu-content ax" >

                        <div class="n-header-menu-content-in">
                            <div class="header__menu-inner header__menu-inner--alt">
                                <div class="articles">
                                    <div class="row">

                                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                                <style nonce="8rAOWBakLq1F5Z45f&#x2B;f&#x2B;bA==">
                                                    .article__image.Deep {
                                                        background-image: url('/americas/getmedia/1f892872-19f3-447b-9dea-b29e6c68835d/debbie-news.jpg');
                                                    }
                                                </style>
                                                <div class="article">
                                                    <div class="article-inner">
                                                        <div class="article__content text-left">
                                                            <p class="article__content-headline">Deeper understanding leads to better outcomes</p>
                                                        </div>

                                                        <div class="article__image Deep">
                                                            <a href="/americas/what-we-do" target="" title="Deeper understanding leads to better outcomes"><span class="sr-only">Deeper understanding leads to better outcomes</span></a>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                                <style nonce="8rAOWBakLq1F5Z45f&#x2B;f&#x2B;bA==">
                                                    .article__image.We {
                                                        background-image: url('/americas/getmedia/b6317e9a-9eef-45aa-b32c-e8bbc798d686/americas-map.jpg');
                                                    }
                                                </style>
                                                <div class="article">
                                                    <div class="article-inner">
                                                        <div class="article__content text-left">
                                                            <p class="article__content-headline">We have the opportunity&#x2014;you bring it to life</p>
                                                        </div>

                                                        <div class="article__image We">
                                                            <a href="/americas/careers" target="" title="We have the opportunity&#x2014;you bring it to life"><span class="sr-only">We have the opportunity&#x2014;you bring it to life</span></a>
                                                        </div>
                                                    </div>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <div class="n-header-dd-content ddc-inactive">
                            <div class="n-header-dd-content-in">
                                        <div class="dd-content-item ddci-inactive" data-id="ee946229-c168-45dd-9e26-57e276159749">
                                            <h2>A rich history underscores purpose, potential, and prosperity</h2>
                                            <p>Our company was built on long-lasting relationships and trust&#x2014;earned through an unshakable foundation and shared success. A steadfast commitment to honor runs through everyone in our organization.</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="dd-content-item ddci-inactive" data-id="eb25a3c0-1703-47c8-b20b-caba46ec1921">
                                            <h2>We know you&#x2060;&#x2014;the depth of what each client really needs</h2>
                                            <p>Our promise is that we will learn your unique business needs&#x2014;in depth&#x2014;and tailor solutions specifically for those needs, intent on helping you grow and prosper.</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="dd-content-item ddci-inactive" data-id="ac9d41b0-63cd-4306-85d3-c54c9447c1a6">
                                            <h2>Connecting to our world</h2>
                                            <p>We invite you to follow along for the latest news and information about SMBC Group in the Americas. Our journey is a long one, steeped in history and innovation to help build a sustainable future. Here you will find the latest about the company and see how we connect to the world around us. Our experts have the industry experience and understanding of world markets, economies, and regulations to put it all in perspective. Our clients are on the leading edge, and we help them achieve their purpose. You can read about it here.</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="dd-content-item ddci-inactive" data-id="5b9fb7fe-9cb9-47cf-9560-2d32c61d35b0">
                                            <h2>Be part of something distinctive</h2>
                                            <p>&#xD;&#xA;When it comes down to it, one of our greatest differentiators is our people. Our people strategize and implement unique solutions&#x2014;nothing pre-packaged for our clients.</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="dd-content-item ddci-inactive" data-id="a83b1c1c-6969-4a61-b9a7-0eaaf2b55a18">
                                            <h2>Our team values expertise, experience, and willing collaborators</h2>
                                            <p>Joining SMBC Group in the Americas feels like coming home for a lot of people. It is an environment where all are respected, teams work together to support one another, and clients get products and services designed just for them.</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="dd-content-item ddci-inactive" data-id="7dd7d8f1-4552-4ec4-a629-89e000246166">
                                            <h2>We&#x2019;re looking for bright and collaborative students to come grow with us</h2>
                                            <p>Get hands-on experience and an inside look at an exciting career in global finance. Our summer intern and analyst programs are designed for rising seniors and recent graduates with diverse backgrounds and skill sets.</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="dd-content-item ddci-inactive" data-id="d2d94cec-1fae-43c3-92a6-bffc3ba8f48a">
                                            <h2>Leaders shape the future of finance</h2>
                                            <p>SMBC Group in the Americas is consistently recognized as a leader in the world of finance for our outstanding service and growth. </p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="dd-content-item ddci-inactive" data-id="351abea5-3345-476f-9134-8944f2c5454a">
                                            <h2>Deeper understanding leads to better outcomes</h2>
                                            <p>We value partnerships and build relationships that last. The collaborative nature of our people and their determination to deliver for you&#x2014;our clients&#x2014;has been a pivotal part of our success.</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="dd-content-item ddci-inactive" data-id="184c505f-d117-4f36-bc63-f6e63f4012a7">
                                            <h2>Our foundation strong, our values unwavering</h2>
                                            <p>A company&#x27;s leadership has a decisive moment when it decides what it is going to stand for and what values will be upheld. It is upon that which the culture is built. We stand for investing in our people and our world. Honor is at our core and with that, prosperity has meaning &#x2014; all of our people stand behind that promise.</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="dd-content-item ddci-inactive" data-id="4400b73d-e991-4e4f-a1e8-b78cfb52f50c">
                                            <h2>Our people define us</h2>
                                            <p>It&#x2019;s not enough to merely tolerate differences. At SMBC Group in the Americas, we value and celebrate the diversity of our people. We know that every individual helps determine who we are as a whole.</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="dd-content-item ddci-inactive" data-id="c1bc780d-571d-4ba8-812e-f51425ce171c">
                                            <h2>Raise capital and invest across assets with confidence</h2>
                                            <p>Each business has unique goals, and no two paths are the same. Our advisors tailor investment solutions that meet short-term needs while remaining focused on long-term plans.</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="dd-content-item ddci-inactive" data-id="04bca940-6d85-4f38-8e06-708b8667b31d">
                                            <h2>Awards and recognition underscore leadership</h2>
                                            <p>SMBC Group in the Americas is consistently recognized for our business, sustainability, and being an inclusive workplace. Our people make all of this happen on behalf of our clients and ourselves.</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="dd-content-item ddci-inactive" data-id="1d5135c7-e9c5-43f3-bb24-338100ab1e2c">
                                            <h2>Manage cash flow securely and efficiently</h2>
                                            <p>SMBC offers end-to-end solutions for payment processes and cash management needs. Our experts combine industry insights with technology to streamline your day-to-day operations and achieve your financial goals&#x2014;all while mitigating risk.</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="dd-content-item ddci-inactive" data-id="a08e1256-65d0-4bff-b26c-0cac6b585eaf">
                                            <h2>Access advanced analysis and smart strategies</h2>
                                            <p>Our analysts, economists, and strategists create timely, in-depth analyses of companies, industries, markets and economies. </p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="dd-content-item ddci-inactive" data-id="7c1abde3-910d-409c-9e65-725b00953a6a">
                                            <h2>Our steadfast promise for a better world</h2>
                                            <p>Throughout our history, SMBC Group has been a responsible corporate citizen. As a financial institution, we&#x2019;ve always understood the role we play in building and sustaining a safer and better world.</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="dd-content-item ddci-inactive" data-id="90da2964-334c-41a9-8991-ba00b6d72a41">
                                            <h2>An international network of passionate collaborators</h2>
                                            <p>In the Americas, we are powered by more than 4,000 dedicated industry experts. We work to deliver comprehensive financial solutions to institutions in seven countries across the Americas.</p>
                                        </div>
                                        <div class="dd-content-item ddci-inactive" data-id="b342f609-f74b-498d-af3c-6e71d9908ecb">
                                            <h2>Expect original commentary, deep understanding, and actionable analysis</h2>
                                            <p>Our role is to ensure you, as the client, have the most up-to-date information and analysis on what&#x2019;s happening in the world and its markets. With the team we have assembled, you are assured the best perspective into the world in which you do business.</p>
                                        </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

